# The packaged editor is ONE process on ONE port: uvicorn serves both the
# API and this bundle, so every call must be relative. An empty value is
# meaningful - src/api.ts uses `??`, so "" survives as "same origin",
# where leaving the variable out would fall back to the dev server's
# http://localhost:8000 and a packaged app would talk to a port nothing
# is listening on.
#
# Only `vite build` reads this. `vite dev` keeps the two-port dev flow.
VITE_EDITOR_API=
